  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/02/FaçanaPerruqueriaCaninaSusana-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"3\">(9 fotos) Peluquer&iacute;a canina Susana ha abierto este lunes, 8 de febrero, sus puertas en la calle Alfonso Pallar&eacute;s, 1-esquina calle Ribesalbes, de Onda. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); white-space: pre-wrap;\" wfd-id=\"2\">De lunes a viernes est&aacute; abierto por las ma&ntilde;anas de 9 a 13.30 horas. Mi&eacute;rcoles y viernes, tambi&eacute;n por la tarde, de 16 a 18 horas. El tel&eacute;fono para coger cita es 601 64 76 80.</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/perruqueriacaninasusana/IMG_20210208_115047.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210208_115047\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/perruqueriacaninasusana/IMG_20210208_115705.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210208_115705\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/perruqueriacaninasusana/IMG_20210208_115714.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210208_115714\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/perruqueriacaninasusana/IMG_20210208_115803.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210208_115803\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/perruqueriacaninasusana/IMG_20210208_115810.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210208_115810\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/perruqueriacaninasusana/IMG_20210208_115910.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210208_115910\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/perruqueriacaninasusana/IMG_20210208_120441.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210208_120441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/perruqueriacaninasusana/facanaperruqueriacaninasusana-1.jpg\" alt=\"facanaperruqueriacaninasusana-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/perruqueriacaninasusana/facanaperruqueriacaninasusana-2.jpg\" alt=\"facanaperruqueriacaninasusana-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
